1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,240
Man: Did you remember to pick up some drinks for Arthur's going away party on your way back to the office?

2
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:13,427
Woman: Oh no. I was so wrapped up in the discussion with the client that it had completely slipped my mind.

3
00:00:13,427 --> 00:00:16,280
Is there time for me to go to the store now?

4
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:20,110
Man: I don't think so. But we should be okay.

5
00:00:20,110 --> 00:00:25,090
I'm pretty sure there are a couple of bottles of soda in the refrigerator in the kitchen downstairs.
